flowchart TD
  Plan[Product need and acceptance criteria] --> Design[Review architecture, data and risks]
  Design --> Implement[Laravel and Vue implementation]
  Implement --> Verify[PHP syntax, tests, frontend build and docs checks]
  Verify --> Review{Checks and review acceptable?}
  Review -->|No| Improve[Fix implementation or documentation]
  Improve --> Implement
  Review -->|Yes| Release[Prepare controlled deployment]
  Release --> Operate[Monitor, back up and maintain]
  Operate --> Feedback[User reports and technical debt]
  Feedback --> Plan
